    "updated_at": "2016-11-10T04:02:47Z",
    "body": "I guess [the section on defining event interfaces](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#defining-event-interfaces) means you've started this (although I didn't check history).  (I got here from [a blink-dev thread on constructors for WebAudio events](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msg/blink-dev/G3V0F7Rh0Io/MuLBeUZeAQAJ).)\n\nPossible other things:\n- having a constructor\n- whether to have onfoo DOM properties and (if target is an element) HTML attributes on the target\n- whether to add support for document.createEvent (no, I think).  (You've already mentioned not introducing init*Event, and I think this goes along.)\n",
